# Environment Configuration
# 
# This project uses compile-time environment detection via Vite's define config.
# No environment files are needed - configuration is handled automatically.
#
# Build commands for different environments:
# - pnpm dev               → Local development (localhost:8080)
# - pnpm build:local       → Local build (localhost:8080) 
# - pnpm build:dev         → AWS development (api-dev.rae-dev.com)
# - pnpm build:prod        → AWS production (api.rae-dev.com)
#
# Environment detection is handled in:
# - src/config/environment.ts (runtime configuration)
# - vite.config.ts (build-time injection)
#
# Legacy environment variable (not recommended):
# VITE_WP_API_BASE=